    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Build a Civilization Through the Ages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is a historical strategy and city-building simulator where you guide your settlement from the Stone Age through key stages of human development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings, grow your economy, provide for your people, and watch the world change alongside your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Placement Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building in <strong>Agecraft</strong> needs the right location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distance to resources, warehouses, and production chains directly affects logistics efficiency and settlement growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.poster.avif?t=1755193744\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.webm?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.mp4?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd28 Step-by-Step Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction isn\u2019t magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units physically deliver resources, and structures are built in stages \u2014 only becoming functional once fully completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.poster.avif?t=1755193744\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.webm?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.mp4?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc77 A Living World of Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People don\u2019t stand still: they carry materials, work, eat, and respond to environmental changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action has a physical presence, making the world feel truly <strong>alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.poster.avif?t=1755193744\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.webm?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.mp4?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc17 Hunting and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is not just beautiful \u2014 it\u2019s a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early ages, hunting wild animals is essential for survival. But creatures like bears can become real threats to your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.poster.avif?t=1755193744\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.webm?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.mp4?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Gameplay progression through historical ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Physical logistics: storage, transportation, resource accessibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Step-by-step construction with visible progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Living population with basic needs and behavior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Natural environment: hunting, danger, survival balance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddea Development Status</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is an indie project currently in active development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far, the following has been implemented:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One historical age (Stone Age)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core mechanics: building, logistics, labor, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world of units with basic simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded What\u2019s Next</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional ages with unique buildings, resources, transport, and technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New systems: social needs, diplomacy, smarter AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved performance, UI, and visual fidelity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Support the Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is crafted with love for strategy games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist, follow development updates, and join the community helping shape the game from day one.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Build a Civilization Through the Ages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is a historical strategy and city-building simulator where you guide your settlement from the Stone Age through key stages of human development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings, grow your economy, provide for your people, and watch the world change alongside your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Placement Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building in <strong>Agecraft</strong> needs the right location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distance to resources, warehouses, and production chains directly affects logistics efficiency and settlement growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.poster.avif?t=1755193744\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.webm?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.mp4?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd28 Step-by-Step Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction isn\u2019t magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units physically deliver resources, and structures are built in stages \u2014 only becoming functional once fully completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.poster.avif?t=1755193744\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.webm?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.mp4?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc77 A Living World of Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People don\u2019t stand still: they carry materials, work, eat, and respond to environmental changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action has a physical presence, making the world feel truly <strong>alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.poster.avif?t=1755193744\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.webm?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.mp4?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc17 Hunting and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is not just beautiful \u2014 it\u2019s a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early ages, hunting wild animals is essential for survival. But creatures like bears can become real threats to your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.poster.avif?t=1755193744\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.webm?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.mp4?t=1755193744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Gameplay progression through historical ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Physical logistics: storage, transportation, resource accessibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Step-by-step construction with visible progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Living population with basic needs and behavior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Natural environment: hunting, danger, survival balance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddea Development Status</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is an indie project currently in active development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far, the following has been implemented:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One historical age (Stone Age)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core mechanics: building, logistics, labor, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world of units with basic simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded What\u2019s Next</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional ages with unique buildings, resources, transport, and technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New systems: social needs, diplomacy, smarter AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved performance, UI, and visual fidelity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Support the Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is crafted with love for strategy games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist, follow development updates, and join the community helping shape the game from day one.</p>",
